### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Đăng ký tài khoản Email/Password (Register)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nguyễn Văn A",
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "age": 22
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Đăng nhập Email/Password (Login)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. GOOGLE LOGIN (Firebase Auth)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 3.1. Login bằng Firebase ID Token (Lấy ID Token từ frontend hoặc Firebase CLI)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/google-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idToken": "PASTE_FIREBASE_ID_TOKEN_HERE"
}

### 3.2. Thiếu idToken -> mong đợi 400
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/google-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
}

### 3.3. idToken không hợp lệ / giả mạo -> mong đợi 401
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/google-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idToken": "fake_token_123456"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Lấy thông tin người dùng hiện tại (/me)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}
GET http://localhost:3001/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Đổi mật khẩu (Change Password)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "oldPassword": "123456",
  "newPassword": "new123456"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. Test RBAC - Gọi trang Admin bằng tài khoản User (Mong đợi: 403 Forbidden)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET http://localhost:3001/api/auth/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. Đăng xuất (Logout)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/logout